{"id":"30.7","doc":"T","title":"GP-SPI Clock Control","words":190,"blocks":[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":1,"c":[{"t":"block","v":"GP-SPI","id":"spi"},{"t":"text","v":" has the following clocks:"}]}]},{"t":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":2,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"clk_spi_mst: module clock of GP-SPI, derived from "},{"t":"field","v":"PLL_CLK"},{"t":"text","v":" or "},{"t":"field","v":"XTAL_CLK"},{"t":"text","v":"."}]},{"n":3,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"It is controlled by bits "},{"t":"field","v":"SPI_MST_CLK_ACTIVE"},{"t":"text","v":" and "},{"t":"field","v":"SPI_MST_CLK_SEL"},{"t":"text","v":"."}]},{"n":4,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"Used in GP-SPI master mode, to generate SPI_CLK signal for data transfer and for slaves."}]}]}],[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":5,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"clk_hclk: module timing compensation clock of GP-SPI."}]},{"n":6,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"When "},{"t":"field","v":"PLL_CLK"},{"t":"text","v":" is available and the bit "},{"t":"field","v":"SPI_TIMING_HCLK_ACTIVE"},{"t":"text","v":" is set, the frequency is "},{"t":"num","v":"160 MHz","k":"frequency"},{"t":"text","v":"; otherwise, it is powered off."}]}]}],[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":7,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"SPI_CLK: output clock in master mode."}]}]}],[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":8,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"APB_CLK: clock for register configuration."}]}]}]]},{"t":"p","s":[{"n":9,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"In master mode, the maximum output clock frequency of GP-SPI is f_clk_spi_mst."}]},{"n":10,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"To have slower frequencies, the output clock frequency can be divided as follows:"}]}]},{"t":"p","s":[{"n":11,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"f_SPI_CLK = f_clk_spi_mst / (("},{"t":"field","v":"SPI_CLKCNT_N"},{"t":"text","v":" + 1) ("},{"t":"field","v":"SPI_CLKDIV_PRE"},{"t":"text","v":" + 1))"}]}]},{"t":"p","s":[{"n":12,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"The divider is configured by "},{"t":"field","v":"SPI_CLKCNT_N"},{"t":"text","v":" and "},{"t":"field","v":"SPI_CLKDIV_PRE"},{"t":"text","v":" in register "},{"t":"reg","v":"SPI_CLOCK_REG"},{"t":"text","v":"."}]},{"n":13,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"When the bit "},{"t":"field","v":"SPI_CLK_EQU_SYSCLK"},{"t":"text","v":" in register "},{"t":"reg","v":"SPI_CLOCK_REG"},{"t":"text","v":" is set to 1, the output clock frequency of GP-SPI will be f_clk_spi_mst."}]},{"n":14,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"And for other integral clock divisions, "},{"t":"field","v":"SPI_CLK_EQU_SYSCLK"},{"t":"text","v":" should be set to 0."}]}]},{"t":"p","s":[{"n":15,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"In slave mode, the supported input clock frequency (f_SPI_CLK) of GP-SPI is:"}]}]},{"t":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":16,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"If f_APB_CLK >= "},{"t":"num","v":"60 MHz","k":"frequency"},{"t":"text","v":", f_SPI_CLK <= "},{"t":"num","v":"60 MHz","k":"frequency"},{"t":"text","v":";"}]}]}],[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":17,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"If f_APB_CLK < "},{"t":"num","v":"60 MHz","k":"frequency"},{"t":"text","v":", f_SPI_CLK <= f_APB_CLK."}]}]}]]}]}